OL,3,GNEWSARising demand from families
OL,4,Aneeding Christmas help
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of families asking for help
OL,7,Fto afford Christmas presents is rising,
OL,8,Faccording to the organiser of a
OL,9,Fcharitable cause.
OL,11,FFor the past two years Charlotte Riley
OL,12,Fhas collected and distributed donated
OL,13,Fgifts voluntarily as part of Christmas
OL,14,FKindness Appeal Jersey which she
OL,15,Forganises through Facebook. The gifts
OL,16,Fare given to families for children aged
OL,17,Fup to 18.
OL,19,FRiley said: "What we are seeing is that
OL,20,Feach year we're getting more and more
OL,21,Fnumbers coming through."
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
